      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_02",
      "hash64": "E3AE76C1046465AC",
      "text": "窸窸窣窣……（人家正在觀察秋明的樣子。）\\n窸窸窣窣……（我們小聲一點說話。）[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
